tive-time density, avoiding division by the vanishing coefficient.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.zero_curvature"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=long&passage=fixed-time-coercivity&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=long&passage=fixed-time-coercivity"},{"ref":"sha256:c4249feffa26e48c24c5690f73e0de4886e40504c8c5c0e6dcb22ec94ea334da/papers/long.md/sha256:135459bb2961c95bd09cfce135666cd5a51fd11bb2c943829fdd7b81efdfef5d/papers/long.json/passages/density","stage":"long","anchor":"density","content_span":{"start_byte":163623,"end_byte":167551,"start_line":3580,"end_line":3636},"section_ref":"sha256:c4249feffa26e48c24c5690f73e0de4886e40504c8c5c0e6dcb22ec94ea334da/papers/long.md/sections/163551","section_title":"9. Density and finite-disorder consequences","claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the smooth-density part through a continuous quotient and simultaneous polynomial-moment bootstrap. Strict positivity is the separate density-positive passage; full support alone does not establish either conclusion.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=long&passage=density&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=long&passage=density"},{"ref":"sha256:c4249feffa26e48c24c5690f73e0de4886e40504c8c5c0e6dcb22ec94ea334da/papers/long.md/sha256:135459bb2961c95bd09cfce135666cd5a51fd11bb2c943829fdd7b81efdfef5d/papers/long.json/passages/density-positive","stage":"long","anchor":"density-positive","content_span":{"start_byte":167611,"end_byte":169938,"start_line":3639,"end_line":3678},"section_ref":"sha256:c4249feffa26e48c24c5690f73e0de4886e40504c8c5c0e6dcb22ec94ea334da/papers/long.md/sections/163551","section_title":"9. Density and finite-disorder consequences","claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation","application"],"rationale":"Applies the shared fixed-time spatial estimate after smoothness and moment saturation. Its proof destination records the nonminimizing artificial plateaus and fixed-strip transfer.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=long&passage=density-positive&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=long&passage=density-positive"},{"ref":"sha256:267b41919f95376c728c2f90f5c80e4bf7aa13ca3418d4931ff608c908902e54/papers/short.md/sha256:cfbe950801fd334d8fd957243fa3b1f716ef609148c5f2ff97d44f9a6443d82c/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","stage":"short","anchor":"density-consequence","content_span":{"start_byte":28022,"end_byte":34477,"start_line":575,"end_line":700},"section_ref":"sha256:267b41919f95376c728c2f90f5c80e4bf7aa13ca3418d4931ff608c908902e54/papers/short.md/sections/27919","section_title":"4. A second use: the density cannot vanish inside the interval","claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"},{"claim_id":"support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity","kinds":["derivation","explanation"],"rationale":"Derives the continuous-coefficient fixed-time inequality by admissible local constant replacement and common-strip convergence of spatial moments, then applies it after q=t. Minimality is unnecessary for the transfer itself.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=short&passage=density-consequence&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=short&passage=density-consequence"},{"ref":"sha256:93145ef5687bb57439b6b2cb17b3f040069f7144f8a92e8bed7d3d18237af961/papers/expository.md/sha256:479155de953858e60f1454491ccda2215d88a4c2780e686cdfb8422481c62d9c/papers/expository.json/passages/density-and-approximation","stage":"expository","anchor":"density-and-approximation","content_span":{"start_byte":58470,"end_byte":59209,"start_line":1396,"end_line":1405},"section_ref":"sha256:93145ef5687bb57439b6b2cb17b3f040069f7144f8a92e8bed7d3d182